  "details": "Sometimes is pretty late when we log in to play or party, the TIPs and RULES waiting world always was to bright for my eyes so basically I just close my eyes and hear the music to know when it ends, Is there a way to just have a ... Black void? Just changing the textures and no globes popping up just a loading bar?\nI was always a fan of the UNIVERSE environment on old VRchat and used to love to see that while waiting and since then I havent been able to enjoy the waiting again, Probably with all the current situation request will be lost in time lol but maybe someone else share the same feel of wanting to have a dark and calm space meanwhile you wait. Maybe Just a click on the menu to go DARK MODE / NIGHT MODE texture change.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4qgMnmU85gc",
